@aspect_bias_risk text
Use this aspect when the task should surface bias-sensitive or selection-risk context that a narrow technical retrieval might miss.
@aspect_bias_risk:meta json
{
  "rev": 1,
  "status": "approved",
  "aspect_type": "bias_oriented",
  "title": "Bias and selection risk",
  "summary": "Select KUs that warn about interpretive bias, selection bias, or omission risk for the current task.",
  "priority": 5,
