@aspect_bias_risk:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by the interpretive or selection risks they help surface.
@aspect_bias_risk:inclusion text
Include KUs that warn about omitted context, selection bias, automation bias, or institutional bias.
@aspect_bias_risk:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that merely use the word bias without explaining a concrete interpretive risk.
@aspect_bias_risk:protocol text
Prefer KUs that should cause the runtime or operator to treat other evidence cautiously rather than taking it at face value.
@aspect_bias_risk:role_vocabulary json
["bias warning", "selection-risk note", "cautionary context"]
@aspect_bias_risk:query_terms json
["bias", "selection", "omission", "caution", "risk"]
